   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:8f",
   "ptr": "0x8f",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "「ダメだ、溶けてる・・・」\\f",
   "en": "\"No good, it's melted...\"",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "カイエス\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:af",
   "ptr": "0xaf",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "死体のそばに、溶けかかった小さな本を\\n",
   "en": "Found a small, half-melted book beside the body.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:d8",
   "ptr": "0xd8",
   "len": 12,
   "jp": "見つけた。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 12,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 08CKD01A:af"
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:e8",
   "ptr": "0xe8",
   "len": 20,
   "jp": "『武器商人の心得』\\f",
   "en": "'The Arms Dealer's Creed'",
   "max": 20,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:100",
   "ptr": "0x100",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "魔物の中には武器の通用しないものがい\\n",
   "en": "Some monsters cannot be harmed by weapons. Shadow soldiers, skeleton soldiers... These cannot be slain with a sword.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:129",
   "ptr": "0x129",
   "len": 6,
   "jp": "る。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 6,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 08CKD01A:100"
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:132",
   "ptr": "0x132",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "影の兵士、骸骨の兵士・・・\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "る。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 08CKD01A:100"
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:151",
   "ptr": "0x151",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "これらは、剣で倒すことは不可能だ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "影の兵士、骸骨の兵士・・・\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 08CKD01A:100"
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:179",
   "ptr": "0x179",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "お客様には、これらの魔物と出会ったな\\n",
   "en": "If a customer meets such monsters, tell them to flee at once, and warn them more than once.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:1a2",
   "ptr": "0x1a2",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "ら即座に逃げるよう説明し、重ねて注意\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 08CKD01A:179"
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:1cb",
   "ptr": "0x1cb",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "を促しておくべきだろう。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 08CKD01A:179"
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:1e9",
   "ptr": "0x1e9",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "しかし、お客様が魔法の使える方、\\n",
   "en": "But if the customer uses magic, or travels with a mage, they can Enchant their sword with magic,",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:20e",
   "ptr": "0x20e",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "もしくは魔法使いを仲間にしてる方\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 08CKD01A:1e9"
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:233",
   "ptr": "0x233",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "だった場合、エンチャントを使用して\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 08CKD01A:1e9"
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:25a",
   "ptr": "0x25a",
   "len": 20,
   "jp": "剣に魔法を付与し、\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 20,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 08CKD01A:1e9"
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:272",
   "ptr": "0x272",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "これらの魔物と戦うことを薦めよう。\\f",
   "en": "and we should recommend they fight these monsters that way.",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:29a",
   "ptr": "0x29a",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "むろん、魔法だけを使っていても影の兵\\n",
   "en": "Of course, magic alone can also defeat shadow soldiers, but keeping that quiet helps our sales...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:2c3",
   "ptr": "0x2c3",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "士は倒せるのだが、そのことを伏せてお\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 08CKD01A:29a"
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:2ec",
   "ptr": "0x2ec",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "くことが、商品の売り上げに繋がってく\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 08CKD01A:29a"
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:315",
   "ptr": "0x315",
   "len": 12,
   "jp": "れる・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 12,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 08CKD01A:29a"
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:32a",
   "ptr": "0x32a",
   "len": 10,
