  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:337",
   "ptr": "0x337",
   "len": 24,
   "jp": "「魔物に溶かされたか」\\f",
   "en": "\"Melted by a monster, then.\"",
   "max": 24,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "カイエス\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:36b",
   "ptr": "0x36b",
   "len": 8,
   "jp": "老学者\\n",
   "en": "Old Scholar",
   "max": 8,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:376",
   "ptr": "0x376",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "「な、なんじゃ、おぬしは？\\n",
   "en": "\"Wh-what in the world? Who might you be, then? Where'd you spring from?\"",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "老学者\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:395",
   "ptr": "0x395",
   "len": 20,
   "jp": "　どこから来た？」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 20,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 08CKD01A:376"
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:3ad",
   "ptr": "0x3ad",
   "len": 8,
   "jp": "老学者\\n",
   "en": "Old Scholar",
   "max": 8,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:3b8",
   "ptr": "0x3b8",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "「・・・なに？　牢屋に岩の魔物が？\\n",
   "en": "\"...What? A rock monster in the jail? Ah, that'd be what they call a Murder Rock.",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "老学者\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:3df",
   "ptr": "0x3df",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　なるほど、そいつはマーダーロックと\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 08CKD01A:3b8"
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:408",
   "ptr": "0x408",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "　いう奴じゃ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 08CKD01A:3b8"
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:41c",
   "ptr": "0x41c",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　おそらく、人の肉の味を覚えて、迷い\\n",
   "en": "Got a taste for human flesh and wandered off, I'd wager.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:445",
   "ptr": "0x445",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "　出て行ったんじゃろう」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 08CKD01A:41c"
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:463",
   "ptr": "0x463",
   "len": 8,
   "jp": "老学者\\n",
   "en": "Old Scholar",
   "max": 8,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:46e",
   "ptr": "0x46e",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「あの魔物は倒すとただの岩に変わるん\\n",
   "en": "\"Beat that monster and it turns into plain rock, you see...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "老学者\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:497",
   "ptr": "0x497",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "　じゃが・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 08CKD01A:46e"
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:4ab",
   "ptr": "0x4ab",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　そのおかげで、狭い場所では道を塞い\\n",
   "en": "Trouble is, in tight spots it'll go and block the way. Have a care when you fight it.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:4d4",
   "ptr": "0x4d4",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　でしまったりもする。闘う時は注意せ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 08CKD01A:4ab"
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:4fd",
   "ptr": "0x4fd",
   "len": 10,
   "jp": "　えよ」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 10,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 08CKD01A:4ab"
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:519",
   "ptr": "0x519",
   "len": 8,
   "jp": "老学者\\n",
   "en": "Old Scholar",
   "max": 8,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:524",
   "ptr": "0x524",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「城へ行きたければ、上へ上へと進むが\\n",
   "en": "\"If you want to reach the castle, keep heading up and up.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "老学者\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:54d",
   "ptr": "0x54d",
   "len": 10,
   "jp": "　よい。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 10,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 08CKD01A:524"
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:55b",
   "ptr": "0x55b",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　わしは、しばらく戻っとらんから、\\n",
   "en": "I've not been back in a good while, so I couldn't rightly say how things stand now.\"",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:582",
   "ptr": "0x582",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　今、どうなってるかは知らんがな」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 08CKD01A:55b"
  },
