   "jp": "老学者\\n",
   "en": "Old Scholar",
   "max": 8,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:5b5",
   "ptr": "0x5b5",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「・・・そういえば、少し前に、黒い髪\\n",
   "en": "\"...Come to think of it, not long ago a black-haired girl came by here and asked the way, same as you, my boy.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "老学者\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:5de",
   "ptr": "0x5de",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　の娘がここに来て、おぬしと同じよう\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 08CKD01A:5b5"
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:607",
   "ptr": "0x607",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "　に道を尋ねて行ったぞ」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 08CKD01A:5b5"
  },
