   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:63e",
   "ptr": "0x63e",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「この部屋は魔物たちの縄張りの境界線\\n",
   "en": "\"This room, you see, sits right on the border of the monsters' territories.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "老学者\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:667",
   "ptr": "0x667",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "　にあるんじゃ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 08CKD01A:63e"
  },
  {
   "id": "08CKD01A:67d",
   "ptr": "0x67d",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　地下道の奴らは廃坑のヌシを恐れて、\\n",
   "en": "The tunnel monsters fear the master of the Abandoned Mine and won't come near. Rest a while before you go.\"",
